/target
**/*.rs.bk
Cargo.lock.bak
# Runtime output under the repo's `.summer/` store. Not `.summer/` wholesale:
# a repository may commit its own `.summer/config.json`, `.summer/policy.json`,
# `.summer/skills/`, or `.summer/commands/` as reviewable project content.
.summer/sessions/
.agents
# Workspace snapshot manifests, written on every run (the /rewind store).
.summer/snapshots/
# Scratch space for spawned children (see SCRATCH_DIR in sandbox/broker.rs).
# Pruned automatically past a day old, but still not something to commit.
.summer/tmp/
